9. College registration must match the student's semester and course.
10. No record may accidentally reference another institution's entity.

For performance:

- Index frequently filtered columns.
- Index institution_id and session_id where appropriate.
- Index foreign keys used in joins.
- Use pagination for large student and attendance lists.
- Avoid fetching all institutional records at once.
- Use efficient reporting views or aggregate queries.
- Recommend partitioning only when actual data volume justifies it.
- Include backup, monitoring and load-testing recommendations.

Do not add unnecessary indexes or partition every table blindly.

